      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1144,
      "text": "But when He gave them a healthy child, they[85] ascribed partners to Him in that which He had given them. Exalted is Allah far above what they ascribe to Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 190,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 175,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1145,
      "text": "Do they ascribe to Him partners who cannot create anything, but are themselves created?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 191,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 175,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1146,
      "text": "They cannot help them, nor can they help themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 192,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 175,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1147,
      "text": "If you call them to guidance, they will not follow you; it is the same whether you call them or remain silent.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 193,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 175,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1148,
      "text": "Those whom you supplicate besides Allah are slaves like you; supplicate them and let them respond to you, if you are truthful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
