      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1149,
      "text": "Do they have feet to walk with? Or hands to grasp with? Or eyes to see with? Or ears to hear with? Say [O Prophet], “Call your idols then conspire against me and give me no respite[86]!",
